{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:3483a5f323e5e3d7","name":"Infamy Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-3483a5f323e5e3d7","title":"Infamy Talent Tree","revision":18279,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:53:40Z","sha256":"85381f38ac2b5bbbe7627cf9f76da6321a6f3263b925c837bac1d86c082a65f9","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18279","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Infamy%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-3483a5f323e5e3d7","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are wanted in multiple systems for criminal acts, and your manner of doing business has earned you an unsavory reputation in the criminal underworld.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Inspire Fear I"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Your infamy and reputation are such that any opponent whose level is equal to or less than your Character Level takes a -1 penalty on attack rolls and opposed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Checks"}," made against you, as well as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," checks made to activate ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Powers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Powers","referenceId":"reference:85acec94cd1ca5f3"}," against you. This is a Mind-Affecting Fear effect.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Inspire Fear II"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Inspire Fear I"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As ",{"tag":"b","children":["Inspire Fear I"]},", except that the penalty increases to -2.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Inspire Fear III"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Inspire Fear II"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As ",{"tag":"b","children":["Inspire Fear I"]},", except that the penalty increases to -5.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["This section was titled Notorious in its official source, but has been renamed to distinguish it from the similarly named \"",{"tag":"a","children":["Notorious"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Notorious"},".\""]}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Notorious Crime Lord"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Your reputation as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Crime Lord"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Crime_Lord","referenceId":"reference:6f4563ed64c9640b"}," is known throughout the galaxy, even on fringe worlds. When you are not ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disguised"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disguised"},", you may reroll any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," checks made to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intimidate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intimidate"},", keeping the better of the two results.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Shared Notoriety"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Notorious Crime Lord"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When your ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Minions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Minions"}]}," invoke your name, others take note. If you have ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Minions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Minions"}]},", they may reroll any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," checks made to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intimidate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intimidate"}," others, but the result of the reroll must be accepted, even if it is worse.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Additional Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Fear Me"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Attract Minion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attract_Minion"}]},", ",{"tag":"b","children":["Inspire Fear II"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Such is the fear you instill in your minions that when in your presence, they would rather die than disappoint you. Once per encounter, as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"}," to one of your ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Minions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Minions"}]}," being moved down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},", you can reduce the number of steps the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Minion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Minion"}]}," moves down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," by 1. Additionally, the target regains ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," equal to your Heroic Level. If the target is reduced to 0 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," or moved to the bottom of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},", you cannot use this Talent on that target.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Frighten"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Attract Minion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attract_Minion"}]},", ",{"tag":"b","children":["Inspire Fear I"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per encounter, you can designate a ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Minion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Minion"}]}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"}," to spread fear among your enemies. At any point before the end of the encounter, you can activate this ability to force all enemies adjacent to your ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Minion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Minion"}]}," to move 1 square away from the ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Minion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Minion"}]},". This movement does not provoke ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attacks of Opportunity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attacks_of_Opportunity","referenceId":"reference:3f19aef95d530255"},". This is a Mind-Affecting effect.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Master Manipulator"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Notorious Crime Lord"]},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Focus (Persuasion)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Focus_(Persuasion)"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When you make a successful ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check, you can immediately make a second ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check against the same target, even if it is not normally allowed. The second ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check need not be for the same use of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," skill as the first. For example, if you successfully ",{"tag":"a","children":["Change Attitude"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Change_Attitude"}," of the target, you can immediately attempt to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Change Attitude"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Change_Attitude"}," a second time, or you can attempt to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intimidate"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intimidate"}," the target instead.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Small Favor"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"},", ",{"tag":"b","children":["Notorious Crime Lord"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can call in a small favor from someone who owes you. Once per day, make a DC 25 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check. If the check is successful, an informant gives you information, granting you a +10 competence bonus to one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gather Information"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gather_Information","referenceId":"reference:a719fb58321fb08c"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge","referenceId":"reference:dcb3e1c00e79236d"}," check made within the next 24 hours.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Terrify"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Frighten"]},", ",{"tag":"b","children":["Inspire Fear II"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check against a target that is within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," and that is also affected by your ",{"tag":"b","children":["Inspire Fear"]}," Talent. If you equal or exceed the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},", then on its next turn the target must spend at least one ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"}," to move away from you. If the target is somehow prevented from doing so, then the penalty from the ",{"tag":"b","children":["Inspire Fear"]}," Talent doubles until the start of your next turn. This is a Mind-Affecting Fear effect.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Unsavory Reputation"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Inspire Fear III"]},", ",{"tag":"b","children":["Notorious Crime Lord"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Any opponent that is reduced to half ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," or fewer while within 6 squares of you takes a -2 penalty on all attack rolls and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Checks"}," for the duration of the encounter. This is a Mind-Affecting Fear effect.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
